*.onnx binary
*.aar binary
*.webm binary
*.mp4 binary
*.wav binary
android-app/app/src/test/screenshots/*.png binary linguist-generated
aura-web/e2e/**/*-snapshots/*.png binary linguist-generated
deploy/config.template.yaml linguist-generated
docs/reference/*.md linguist-generated
CAPABILITIES.md linguist-generated
android-app/app/src/main/assets/console-offline.html linguist-generated -diff
